  "description": "Having been hurt by love, Ah-yeon is terrified of starting over. One drunken night, however, he ends up making a mistake with Hyun-oh, a younger man with a puppy-like charm.\n\nAh-yeon has sworn never to love again, yet Hyun-oh shows no hesitation in giving and receiving affection, showering Ah-yeon with an overwhelming barrage of attention. Though Hyun-oh’s type is the complete opposite of what Ah-yeon thinks they can handle, Ah-yeon finds that he isn’t entirely unwelcome...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/tjxns_S2_), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/clumsy_love)",
